Cell["\<\
Every entry is a fibration. The trivial and covering entries are fiber \
bundles; the tangent, displacement and branched entries are not.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"cbb49e3c-a0dc-4c38-a1af-da74da4fd1fd"],

